      "highestRisk": { "id": "ASSUME-ROLE-EXPANSION", "severity": "critical", "path": "Principal -> sts:AssumeRole -> assumed role (unknown privileges)" }
    },
    "graphNote": "IAM-107: each PassRole compound path is encoded as a transition through an unknown-privileges pivot - principal --can-pass--> role:passable:{svc} --can-execute-as--> service:{svc} - not a direct principal->service spoke. The pivot node carries the analyzer's KNOWN/UNKNOWN split (the two grants are known; the passed role's privileges are not).",
